  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Pavilion Green Hydrogen Summit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on the Dutch contribution/study visit and part of the European Union (EU) pavilion at the African Hydrogen Summit in Cape Town and brings together local needs and Dutch knowledge and expertise in the field of green hydrogen development.It provides a unique opportunity to share knowledge, provide exposure to Dutch innovations, and link Dutch companies and knowledge institutes to their South African and general African counterparts to foster cooperation.The pavilion will showcase the Dutch capabilities in green hydrogen across various industries including pipeline development, hydrogen production and usage, water management etc. The stand will also play a central role at the conference for business-to-business (B2B) matchmaking, the organisation of a networking event (paid by the Netherlands embassy), where relevant African Business Partners will meet the visiting Dutch companies, and the promotion of the Dutch companies present.</narrative>
  </description>
